selftext:
Hey all, me and a couple friends recently put together a small Discord around stocks/market news and mostly AI names. Nothing paid or anything, just a place we’re trying to build out with a free news feed, some separate channels for different stocks, and a bot for price alerts/tracking.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Still pretty early and we’re mostly just trying to make it useful, so if anyone wants to check it out or give suggestions on what would actually make a server like this worth using, I’d appreciate it.

&#x200B;

If anyone’s interested I can drop the link.
